==Strategy==
Upon starting this stage, you are immediately greeted by a pair of Kang Roos and an Otta-smack-u headed straight for your base. With limited cash from the lack of any peons, it is hard to kill them before they are already hitting your base. Rather than spamming meatshields to push them away, it may be best to allow your base to take damage in order to save up for powerful units such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]]. Once the initial enemies are dealt with, the Otta rush on base hit isn't too hard: simply maintain a constant line of meatshields, [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] or a similar attacker, and Bahamut.

To ensure you survive the initial wave, obtaining the [[Ancient Tablet]] will help your base withstand the assault until your own attack can be deployed. If you're struggling, collecting all the superior treasures for the Ancient Tablet can help.

